---
---

<section class="hero-fullbleed" aria-label="Sección principal">
  <!-- Background photo placeholder -->
  <div class="hero-fullbleed-bg">
    <div class="ph">
      <!-- Replace this div with <img src="/foto-hero.jpg" alt="..." class="ph-img" /> -->
      <div class="ph-caption">FOTO REAL · FONDO COMPLETO — Sugerencia: foto wide del equipo o clínica, alta resolución, tonos cálidos / luz natural</div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-fullbleed-overlay"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container hero-fullbleed-content">
    <!-- Eyebrow -->
    <span class="hero-eyebrow">Clínica Dental · Espinar & Arequipa</span>

    <!-- H1 -->
    <h1 class="hero-fullbleed-title">
      Tu sonrisa,<br/>
      <strong>nuestra pasión</strong>.
    </h1>

    <!-- Lede -->
    <p class="hero-fullbleed-lede">
      Atención dental cercana, profesional y sin miedos. Desde tu primera limpieza hasta el diseño completo de sonrisa, te acompañamos con calma y resultados que se ven.
    </p>

    <!-- CTAs -->
    <div class="hero-cta-group">
      <a href="#reservar" class="btn btn-accent">
        Chequeo y diagnóstico
        <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2.5">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <a href="#reservar" class="btn btn-outline-white">Reservar cita</a>
    </div>

    <!-- Help text -->
    <p class="hero-help-text">
      <svg width="14" height="14" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:#2ECC71;flex-shrink:0">
        <path d="M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.27 2 8.5 2 5.41 4.42 3 7.5 3c1.74 0 3.41.81 4.5 2.08C13.09 3.81 14.76 3 16.5 3 19.58 3 22 5.41 22 8.5c0 3.77-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.53L12 21.35z"/>
      </svg>
      ¿Tienes dolor o no sabes qué tratamiento necesitas? Empieza por aquí — orientación gratuita y sin compromiso.
    </p>

    <!-- Stats -->
    <div class="hero-fullbleed-stats">
      <div class="hfb-stat">
        <div class="hfb-stat-num">15+</div>
        <div class="hfb-stat-lbl">Años cuidando sonrisas</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hfb-stat">
        <div class="hfb-stat-num">8.4k</div>
        <div class="hfb-stat-lbl">Pacientes felices</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hfb-stat">
        <div class="hfb-stat-num">2</div>
        <div class="hfb-stat-lbl">Sedes en el sur</div>
      </div>
      <div class="hfb-stat">
        <div class="hfb-stat-num" style="color: #2ECC71;">★ 4.9</div>
        <div class="hfb-stat-lbl">+800 reseñas Google</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-fullbleed {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 720px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    /* Pull up behind the fixed header so its dark bg shows through */
    margin-top: -76px;
    padding: calc(80px + 76px) 0 80px;
    overflow: hidden;
    color: white;
  }

  .hero-fullbleed-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .ph {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1B3F90 0%, #15327a 60%, #0e1f3d 100%);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .ph::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 0, transparent 18px, rgba(255,255,255,.04) 18px, rgba(255,255,255,.04) 19px);
  }
  /* When a real photo is used, style it: */
  .ph-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
  }
  .ph-caption {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 14px;
    left: 14px;
    right: 14px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.4);
    font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
  }

  .hero-fullbleed-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(11,29,51,.85) 0%, rgba(11,29,51,.55) 50%, rgba(11,29,51,.4) 100%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(11,29,51,.3) 0%, transparent 40%, rgba(11,29,51,.5) 100%);
  }

  .hero-fullbleed-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    max-width: 780px;
  }

  .hero-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.8);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .hero-eyebrow::before {
    content: '';
    width: 18px;
    height: 1px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.6);
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .hero-fullbleed-title {
    color: white !important;
    margin-top: 0;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 5.8vw, 76px);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
  }
  .hero-fullbleed-title strong {
    color: #2ECC71;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .hero-fullbleed-lede {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.85);
    margin-top: 22px;
    font-size: 19px;
    max-width: 580px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .hero-cta-group {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 32px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .hero-help-text {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.7);
    max-width: 560px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .hero-fullbleed-stats {
    display: flex;
    gap: 40px;
    margin-top: 56px;
    padding-top: 32px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .hfb-stat-num {
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: white;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
  }
  .hfb-stat-lbl {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.7);
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .hero-fullbleed { min-height: 560px; margin-top: -64px; padding: calc(64px + 64px) 0 48px; }
    .hero-fullbleed-stats { gap: 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; padding-top: 24px; margin-top: 40px; }
    .hfb-stat-num { font-size: 28px; }
    .hero-fullbleed-lede { font-size: 17px; }
  }
</style>
